---
<section class="bg-[var(--light-grey)] py-16 md:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-[1000px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-12">
    <div class="reveal grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-12 items-center">
      <div
        class="aspect-[4/3] bg-[var(--dark-charcoal)] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white/40 text-sm"
        role="img"
        aria-label="Wide shot of the Victorian warehouse interior at Pixley Street"
      >
        [studio photo placeholder]
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--dark-charcoal)] mb-4">The space</h2>
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-[var(--dark-charcoal)] mb-4">
          A converted Victorian warehouse on Pixley Street, beside the Limehouse Cut. Two self-serve studios with sprung floors, full-height mirrors, and natural light.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-[var(--dark-charcoal)]">
          Part of the wider Hone maker and creative community in East London. Affordable, professional, available 6am to midnight.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
